le bring-bring sounded with interruption. A phone on a side table next to Victor Zarruq.", "reference": "2023, J. A. Bouma, chapter 9, in End of Days (Order of Thaddeus; 13), Grand Rapids, Mich.: EmmausWay Press, →ISBN:"}], "synonyms": ["ringaling", "tingaling", "ring-a-ding", "ding-a-ling"], "antonyms": [], "translations": [], "subsenses": []}], "synonyms": [], "antonyms": []}], "source": {"url": "https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bring", "license": {"name": "CC BY-SA 4.0", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"}}}}